# Saasify architecture

- Follow `AGENTS.md` and `specs/architecture.md`.
- Features live under `lib/features/<feature>/` with clean layers.
- Shared widgets only in `lib/core/widgets/`.
- State management is BLoC/Cubit only — do not add other state libraries.
- Do not invent features not present in `specs/` or the user prompt.
- Keep `main.dart` limited to bootstrap (`WidgetsFlutterBinding`, `runApp`).
